# Reserved for modular Bicep.
#
# Per `specs/001-azure-stig-dashboard/plan.md` and `tasks.md` (T031-T033,
# T223, T410), the monolithic `infra/main.bicep` will be refactored into:
#   - network.bicep         (VNet, subnets, Private DNS, Private Endpoints)
#   - identity.bicep        (managed identities + least-privilege RBAC)
#   - data.bicep            (Postgres Flexible Server, Key Vault)
#   - app.bicep             (App Service / Container Apps)
#   - observability.bicep   (App Insights, Log Analytics, workbooks)
#   - messaging.bicep       (Service Bus, Event Grid)
#   - policy.bicep          (Guest Configuration policy assignments)
#   - storage.bicep         (immutable Blob container for STIG content cache)
#
# `main.bicep` becomes a thin composition root.
